6.3 Referential Integrity
Every partial_result.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every implication.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every counterexample.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every computational_check.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every bound.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every conjecture_relation.conjecture_id and conjecture_relation.related_conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every work_link.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every verification_link.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every provenance.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

Every moderation.conjecture_id must exist in mathematical_conjecture.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The conjecture relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

Every implication.implication_target must resolve to a conjecture or be flagged as unresolved.

